WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:04.937 --> 00:00:12.144
♪ ♪

00:00:09.141 --> 00:00:13.946
&gt;&gt; GOING THROUGH THE REVIEW

00:00:12.278 --> 00:00:15.448
PERIOD, WE ARE VERY LUCKY WE

00:00:14.080 --> 00:00:17.116
HAVE THE BEST NEGOTIATOR AT THE

00:00:15.581 --> 00:00:18.717
TABLE IN THE PRESIDENT, IT WILL

00:00:17.249 --> 00:00:20.619
BE A COUPLE MONTHS BEFORE

00:00:18.851 --> 00:00:21.921
TARIFFS ON EITHER SIDE WOULD GO

00:00:20.753 --> 00:00:22.755
INTO EFFECT AND BE IMPLEMENTED.

00:00:22.054 --> 00:00:24.924
AND WE ARE HOPEFUL THAT CHINA

00:00:22.888 --> 00:00:27.560
WILL DO THE RIGHT THING.

00:00:25.057 --> 00:00:29.829
LOOK, CHINA CREATED THIS

00:00:27.693 --> 00:00:30.563
PROBLEM, NOT PRESIDENT TRUMP.

00:00:29.962 --> 00:00:31.230
&gt;&gt; Chris: WHITE HOUSE

00:00:30.696 --> 00:00:32.565
SPOKESWOMAN SARAH HUCKABEE

00:00:31.363 --> 00:00:34.667
SANDERS DESCRIBING THE STATE OF

00:00:32.698 --> 00:00:35.034
TRADE RELATIONS BETWEEN THE U.S.

00:00:34.800 --> 00:00:36.802
AND CHINA.

00:00:35.167 --> 00:00:39.171
TIME TO BRING IN OUR PANEL.

00:00:36.936 --> 00:00:39.538
STEVE HAYES OF THE WEEKLY

00:00:39.305 --> 00:00:41.474
STANDARD.

00:00:39.672 --> 00:00:43.976
MOLLIE HEMINGWAY FROM "THE

00:00:41.607 --> 00:00:44.643
FEDERALIST," AND CHARLES LANE AT

00:00:44.110 --> 00:00:48.180
"THE WASHINGTON POST."

00:00:44.777 --> 00:00:49.648
STEVE, CHINA, I THINK IT'S FAIR

00:00:48.314 --> 00:00:50.749
TO SAY THAT THEY STRUCK BACK

00:00:49.782 --> 00:00:53.152
HARDER THAN PEOPLE EXPECTED,

00:00:50.883 --> 00:00:54.086
ANNOUNCING TARIFFS ON

00:00:53.285 --> 00:00:55.121
$50 BILLION OF U.S. EXPORTS,

00:00:54.220 --> 00:00:56.922
INCLUDING SOYBEANS, WHICH IS

00:00:55.254 --> 00:00:59.125
REALLY KEY, A BIG MARKET AND

00:00:57.056 --> 00:00:59.959
CHINA FOR U.S. SOYBEANS AND ALSO

00:00:59.258 --> 00:01:02.261
AIRCRAFT.

00:01:00.092 --> 00:01:03.329
BUT NO DATES WERE SET AND THE

00:01:02.394 --> 00:01:04.163
TRUMP ADMINISTRATION SAYS IT IS

00:01:03.462 --> 00:01:06.265
NOT SETTING A DATE.

00:01:04.296 --> 00:01:08.734
IT WILL GO TO A PROCESS THAT

00:01:06.398 --> 00:01:10.336
GOES INTO MID OR LATE MAY.

00:01:08.868 --> 00:01:10.736
ARE WE IN A TRADE WAR WITH CHINA

00:01:10.469 --> 00:01:12.938
OR NOT?

00:01:10.870 --> 00:01:13.939
&gt;&gt; WE ARE AWFUL CLOSE IF WE ARE

00:01:13.072 --> 00:01:16.108
NOT THERE ALREADY.

00:01:14.073 --> 00:01:17.143
THE BIG QUESTION IS WHETHER THIS

00:01:16.242 --> 00:01:18.344
IS BLUSTER FROM THE TRUMP

00:01:17.276 --> 00:01:20.279
ADMINISTRATION AND A STRONG PUSH

00:01:18.477 --> 00:01:22.915
BACK, CERTAINLY A STRONGER

00:01:20.412 --> 00:01:23.649
PUSHBACK THAN MANY IN THE TRUMP

00:01:23.048 --> 00:01:25.751
ADMINISTRATION HAD ANTICIPATED.

00:01:23.782 --> 00:01:27.953
PETER NAVARRO EXPECTED THAT HE

00:01:25.885 --> 00:01:29.088
DIDN'T EXPECT THEM TO RETALIATE

00:01:28.087 --> 00:01:30.556
BECAUSE THEY RECOGNIZE WE WERE

00:01:29.221 --> 00:01:31.790
JUST TRYING TO BALANCE WITH THE

00:01:30.689 --> 00:01:32.525
TRUMP ADMINISTRATION SEES AS A

00:01:31.924 --> 00:01:35.094
TRADE IMBALANCE AND LO AND

00:01:32.658 --> 00:01:36.162
BEHOLD WE ARE SEEING PRETTY

00:01:35.227 --> 00:01:37.630
SERIOUS RETALIATION.

00:01:36.295 --> 00:01:38.597
THE CHINESE WERE SMART AND

00:01:37.763 --> 00:01:38.998
STRATEGIC ABOUT HOW THEY

00:01:38.731 --> 00:01:41.433
RETALIATED.

00:01:39.131 --> 00:01:43.068
IT'S VERY CLEAR THAT THEY PICKED

00:01:41.567 --> 00:01:44.904
INDUSTRIES AND PRODUCTS THAT

00:01:43.202 --> 00:01:46.438
HELP FUEL THE ECONOMY IN RED

00:01:45.037 --> 00:01:47.640
STATES, WHERE DONALD TRUMP DID

00:01:46.572 --> 00:01:48.107
WELL, STATES THAT DONALD TRUMP

00:01:47.773 --> 00:01:50.543
WON IN.

00:01:48.240 --> 00:01:51.844
THOSE ARE GOING TO BE

00:01:50.676 --> 00:01:54.146
POTENTIALLY POLITICALLY PAINFUL

00:01:51.977 --> 00:01:55.114
FOR THE PRESIDENT IF, IN FACT,

00:01:54.280 --> 00:01:56.582
THIS GOES THROUGH.

00:01:55.247 --> 00:01:58.350
I WOULD SAY AS SOMEONE WHO

00:01:56.715 --> 00:01:59.151
BELIEVES IN FREE TRADE, I WAS

00:01:58.484 --> 00:01:59.919
ENCOURAGED BY THE RHETORIC

00:01:59.285 --> 00:02:01.487
COMING FROM THE WHITE HOUSE.

00:02:00.052 --> 00:02:02.688
WE ARE A LONG WAY FROM THE

00:02:01.620 --> 00:02:03.756
PRESIDENT'S DECLARATION JUST

00:02:02.821 --> 00:02:14.600
FOUR WEEKS AGO THAT TRADE WARS

00:02:03.889 --> 00:02:15.301
ARE GOOD AND EASY TO WIN RATED

00:02:14.733 --> 00:02:16.001
WE ARE NOT HEARING PEOPLE LIKE

00:02:15.434 --> 00:02:16.602
LARRY KUDLOW AND OTHERS SAYING

00:02:16.135 --> 00:02:17.336
TRADE WARS AREN'T GOOD.

00:02:16.735 --> 00:02:18.070
THE PRESIDENT IS A FREE TRADER.

00:02:17.469 --> 00:02:18.804
WE WANT TO TRADE FREELY, WE JUST

00:02:18.204 --> 00:02:19.138
DON'T WANT TO BE SCREWED IN THE

00:02:18.938 --> 00:02:19.838
PROCESS.

00:02:19.271 --> 00:02:20.339
&gt;&gt; Chris: MOLLIE, ARE WE IN A

00:02:19.972 --> 00:02:21.740
TRADE WAR OR NOT?

00:02:20.472 --> 00:02:23.542
SPEAK OF THE SITUATION IS FOR

00:02:21.874 --> 00:02:24.276
THE LAST SEVERAL DECADES, THE

00:02:23.676 --> 00:02:24.977
UNITED STATES AND OTHER GLOBAL

00:02:24.410 --> 00:02:26.245
ENTITIES HAVE TRIED TO TREAT

00:02:25.110 --> 00:02:27.780
CHINA LIKE ONE OF THE BIG BOYS

00:02:26.378 --> 00:02:30.149
IN THE HOPES THAT THEY WOULD

00:02:27.913 --> 00:02:30.883
RISE TO THE OCCASION, IF

00:02:30.282 --> 00:02:32.384
THEY HAD A GREATER PARTICIPATION

00:02:31.016 --> 00:02:34.019
IN THE GLOBAL ECONOMY, THEY

00:02:32.518 --> 00:02:35.421
WOULDN'T BE DOING ALL OF THESE

00:02:34.153 --> 00:02:36.922
HUMAN RIGHTS ABUSES, THEY

00:02:35.554 --> 00:02:38.757
WOULDN'T CONTINUE THE UNFAIR

00:02:37.056 --> 00:02:39.925
TRADE PRACTICES, THEY ARE

00:02:38.891 --> 00:02:40.226
DUMPING, INTELLECTUAL PROPERTY

00:02:40.059 --> 00:02:41.360
THEFT.

00:02:40.359 --> 00:02:41.694
WHAT HAS HAPPENED AS THEY

00:02:41.493 --> 00:02:42.728
HAVEN'T.

00:02:41.827 --> 00:02:44.730
THEY HAVE BENEFITED FROM BEING

00:02:42.861 --> 00:02:46.265
ALLOWED TO BE PART OF THAT

00:02:44.863 --> 00:02:47.299
GLOBAL ECONOMY BUT THEY HAVEN'T

00:02:46.398 --> 00:02:49.201
CHANGED THESE PRACTICES.

00:02:47.433 --> 00:02:51.737
THERE IS WORSE THAN EVER.

00:02:49.335 --> 00:02:53.372
THEY SUPPORT NORTH KOREA, THEY

00:02:51.870 --> 00:02:53.939
HAVE GAINED QUITE A BIT AND WE

00:02:53.505 --> 00:02:56.041
HAVE NOT GOTTEN MUCH.

00:02:54.073 --> 00:02:57.443
I THINK WHAT PEOPLE ARE TRYING

00:02:56.175 --> 00:02:58.944
TO DO IS PUSH BACK AGAINST SOME

00:02:57.576 --> 00:03:00.279
OF THIS AND PEOPLE WHO DO OPPOSE

00:02:59.078 --> 00:03:02.848
TARIFFS AND TARIFFS ARE A TAX ON

00:03:00.412 --> 00:03:04.049
THE PEOPLE, THEY DO HAVE

00:03:02.982 --> 00:03:04.750
ECONOMIC COSTS, THEY ALSO

00:03:04.183 --> 00:03:05.351
ACHIEVE SOME PRESSURE AGAINST

00:03:04.883 --> 00:03:07.052
OTHER COUNTRIES.

00:03:05.484 --> 00:03:09.922
PEOPLE WHO DON'T THINK THAT WE

00:03:07.186 --> 00:03:10.623
SHOULD USE TARIFFS TO FIGHT THIS

00:03:10.055 --> 00:03:11.423
MASSIVE INTELLECTUAL PROPERTY

00:03:10.756 --> 00:03:12.291
THEFT THAT COMES FROM CHINA

00:03:11.557 --> 00:03:13.993
SHOULD PROBABLY COME UP WITH

00:03:12.424 --> 00:03:14.426
OTHER GOOD WAYS TO DEAL WITH

00:03:14.126 --> 00:03:17.496
THIS PROBLEM.

00:03:14.560 --> 00:03:18.297
&gt;&gt; Chris: IT IS INTERESTING,

00:03:17.630 --> 00:03:20.232
CHUCK, THE FUTURES ON THE

00:03:18.430 --> 00:03:21.767
DOW JONES WERE DOWN 500 POINTS,

00:03:20.366 --> 00:03:25.271
THE FACT THAT MARKET DROPPED 500

00:03:21.900 --> 00:03:26.438
POINTS TODAY AND ENDED UP OFF

00:03:25.404 --> 00:03:30.142
230 POINTS.

00:03:26.572 --> 00:03:30.743
THAT IS A 730-POINT SWING.

00:03:30.276 --> 00:03:32.411
CLEARLY, THE MARKET WAS

00:03:30.876 --> 00:03:33.912
PERSUADED BY THE END OF THE DAY

00:03:32.544 --> 00:03:35.381
THAT WE ARE NOT HEADED FOR A

00:03:34.046 --> 00:03:36.115
TRADE WAR, AT LEAST NOT

00:03:35.514 --> 00:03:40.119
IMMEDIATELY AND THERE IS A

00:03:36.248 --> 00:03:41.754
POSSIBILITY THAT THIS BLUSTER

00:03:40.252 --> 00:03:42.388
AND TALK ABOUT TARIFFS MAY END

00:03:41.887 --> 00:03:44.523
UP IN A DEAL.

00:03:42.521 --> 00:03:44.823
&gt;&gt; IF SO, I THINK THE MARKET IS

00:03:44.657 --> 00:03:46.325
RIGHT.

00:03:44.957 --> 00:03:47.726
THERE IS A POSSIBILITY.

00:03:46.458 --> 00:03:50.329
BUT WE DON'T KNOW.

00:03:47.860 --> 00:03:51.697
IT'S GOING TO TAKE PROBABLY A

00:03:50.462 --> 00:03:51.997
FEW MONTHS TO COME TO REST ON

00:03:51.830 --> 00:03:53.432
THIS.

00:03:52.131 --> 00:03:54.867
I HAVE BEEN REPORTING ON THIS

00:03:53.565 --> 00:03:57.503
FOR THE POST OVER THE LAST WEEK

00:03:57.636 --> 00:04:01.140
TRADE FOR A LONG TIME.

00:03:58.304 --> 00:04:01.940
WHAT STRUCK ME ABOUT MY

00:04:01.273 --> 00:04:03.742
CONVERSATION THIS WEEK WITH

00:04:02.074 --> 00:04:05.911
PEOPLE WHO ARE FREE TRADERS AND

00:04:03.876 --> 00:04:08.380
WHO SUPPORT THE WTO IS HOW MANY

00:04:06.045 --> 00:04:09.615
OF THEM, EVEN MANY DEMOCRATS,

00:04:08.514 --> 00:04:12.051
WILL PRIVATELY SAY, THE

00:04:09.748 --> 00:04:13.319
PRESIDENT IS DEALING WITH A REAL

00:04:12.184 --> 00:04:14.653
PROBLEM HERE WITH RESPECT TO

00:04:13.452 --> 00:04:16.655
CHINA.

00:04:14.787 --> 00:04:19.091
CHINA HAS BEEN STEALING AMERICAN

00:04:16.789 --> 00:04:20.326
INTELLECTUAL PROPERTY.

00:04:19.224 --> 00:04:21.894
CHINA BARS U.S. INVESTORS FROM

00:04:20.459 --> 00:04:24.129
OPERATING IN CHINA, UNLESS THEY

00:04:22.027 --> 00:04:25.164
AGREE TO TURN OVER THEIR

00:04:24.263 --> 00:04:26.265
TECHNOLOGY.

00:04:25.297 --> 00:04:27.666
EVEN MANY OF THESE FREE TRADERS

00:04:26.398 --> 00:04:28.734
WERE SAYING IF IT TAKES TARIFFS

00:04:27.800 --> 00:04:31.170
TO GET THEIR ATTENTION AND BRING

00:04:28.867 --> 00:04:31.503
THEM TO THE TABLE, WE ARE FOR

00:04:31.303 --> 00:04:33.138
THAT.

00:04:31.637 --> 00:04:35.341
THE QUESTION, OF COURSE, IS ONCE

00:04:33.272 --> 00:04:35.774
THEY ARE AT THE TABLE, WHO HAS

00:04:35.474 --> 00:04:37.543
MORE LEVERAGE?

00:04:35.908 --> 00:04:39.411
WHO IS GOING TO BE BETTER ABLE

00:04:37.676 --> 00:04:40.746
TO GET TO A DEAL?

00:04:39.545 --> 00:04:42.014
ULTIMATELY, WHAT THE PRESIDENT'S

00:04:40.879 --> 00:04:42.448
END GAME IS, WHAT IS REAL

00:04:42.147 --> 00:04:43.782
OBJECTIVE IS.

00:04:42.581 --> 00:04:46.185
AND ON THAT ONE, I THINK THERE

00:04:43.916 --> 00:04:46.585
IS STILL A LITTLE BIT OF

00:04:46.318 --> 00:04:48.153
UNCERTAINTY.

00:04:46.719 --> 00:04:48.987
&gt;&gt; Chris: THEN, THERE IS THE

00:04:48.287 --> 00:04:51.357
SOUTHERN BORDER, AND HERE WAS

00:04:49.121 --> 00:04:51.957
THE SECRETARY OF HOMELAND

00:04:51.490 --> 00:04:54.493
SECURITY NIELSEN AT THE

00:04:52.091 --> 00:04:56.662
WHITE HOUSE TODAY.

00:04:54.626 --> 00:04:57.363
&gt;&gt; THE PRESIDENT HAS DIRECTED

00:04:56.795 --> 00:04:58.764
THE DEPARTMENT OF DEFENSE AND

00:04:57.496 --> 00:05:00.366
THE DEPARTMENT OF HOMELAND

00:04:58.897 --> 00:05:01.934
SECURITY WORKED TOGETHER WITH

00:05:00.499 --> 00:05:03.102
OUR GOVERNORS TO DEPLOY THE

00:05:02.067 --> 00:05:05.371
NATIONAL GUARD TOWER SOUTHWEST

00:05:03.235 --> 00:05:05.704
BORDER TO ASSIST THE BORDER

00:05:05.504 --> 00:05:08.307
PATROL.

00:05:05.838 --> 00:05:09.274
THE PRESIDENT WILL BE SENDING A

00:05:08.440 --> 00:05:09.575
PROCLAMATION TO THAT EFFECT

00:05:09.408 --> 00:05:11.377
TODAY.

00:05:09.708 --> 00:05:13.312
&gt;&gt; Chris: MOLLIE, THERE WAS

00:05:11.510 --> 00:05:13.979
SOME SUGGESTION, AND

00:05:13.445 --> 00:05:15.414
JOHN ROBERTS REPORTING, THE

00:05:14.113 --> 00:05:17.549
PRESIDENT'S REAL GOAL HERE, YES,

00:05:15.547 --> 00:05:18.350
HE IS GOING TO SEND THE

00:05:17.683 --> 00:05:20.119
NATIONAL GUARD, AND YES, HE

00:05:18.484 --> 00:05:21.053
WANTS TO HELP PROTECT THE

00:05:20.252 --> 00:05:23.355
BORDER, BUT THE REAL POINT HERE

00:05:21.186 --> 00:05:25.457
IS TO TRY TO PUT MORE PRESSURE

00:05:23.489 --> 00:05:25.758
ON CONGRESS TO FINANCE THIS

00:05:25.591 --> 00:05:29.828
WALL.

00:05:25.891 --> 00:05:30.896
&gt;&gt; EVERY PRESIDENT SINCE REAGAN

00:05:29.962 --> 00:05:32.131
HAS SENT TROOPS TO THE BORDER.

00:05:31.029 --> 00:05:34.133
THIS IS NOT NEW.

00:05:32.264 --> 00:05:34.700
WE DON'T HAVE SPECIFICS ON WHAT

00:05:34.266 --> 00:05:36.335
HE'S THINKING.

00:05:34.833 --> 00:05:37.536
BUT THIS IS A VERY POLITICALLY

00:05:36.468 --> 00:05:39.805
SENSITIVE ISSUE AND HE KEEPS ON

00:05:37.669 --> 00:05:40.939
TRYING TO DRAW THE CONTRAST

00:05:39.938 --> 00:05:41.573
BETWEEN REPUBLICAN APPROACHES

00:05:41.073 --> 00:05:44.109
AND DEMOCRATIC APPROACHES.

00:05:41.707 --> 00:05:45.711
DEMOCRATS IN PARTICULAR FEEL

00:05:44.243 --> 00:05:47.513
THIS IS A GOOD ISSUE FOR THEM TO

00:05:45.844 --> 00:05:48.914
HAVE MORE LAX ENFORCEMENT OF THE

00:05:47.646 --> 00:05:50.516
BORDER, TO ALLOW MORE PEOPLE TO

00:05:49.047 --> 00:05:52.484
ENTER THE COUNTRY ILLEGALLY,

00:05:50.649 --> 00:05:53.152
FOLLOW-UP WITH WITH AMNESTY

00:05:52.618 --> 00:05:53.919
PROGRAMS WITHOUT FIXING THE

00:05:53.285 --> 00:05:55.687
BORDER.

00:05:54.052 --> 00:05:56.455
IT WAS A HUGE ISSUE THAT HE

00:05:55.821 --> 00:05:59.591
SUCCEEDED -- THAT WENT WELL FOR

00:05:56.588 --> 00:06:00.159
HIM DURING THE CAMPAIGN, TO

00:05:59.725 --> 00:06:02.027
HIGHLIGHT THAT BORDER

00:06:00.292 --> 00:06:02.694
ENFORCEMENT IS LAX AND THAT WE

00:06:02.161 --> 00:06:03.896
DON'T HAVE A REALLY SENSIBLE

00:06:02.828 --> 00:06:05.597
IMMIGRATION POLICY.

00:06:04.029 --> 00:06:06.498
THE MORE HE CAN HIGHLIGHT THIS,

00:06:05.731 --> 00:06:08.100
THE BETTER FOR HIM.

00:06:06.632 --> 00:06:09.435
&gt;&gt; Chris: I WANT TO GET -- WE

00:06:08.233 --> 00:06:10.736
HAVE ABOUT A MINUTE LEFT IN THE

00:06:09.568 --> 00:06:11.136
SEGMENT -- STEVE, TO ONE MORE

00:06:10.869 --> 00:06:14.039
THING.

00:06:11.270 --> 00:06:14.606
THE NEWS TODAY, THE SPECIAL

00:06:14.173 --> 00:06:15.340
COUNSEL ROBERT MUELLER

00:06:14.740 --> 00:06:17.276
APPARENTLY TOLD THE PRESIDENT'S

00:06:15.474 --> 00:06:19.178
LAWYERS THAT HE IS NOT THE

00:06:17.409 --> 00:06:19.878
TARGET OF A CRIMINAL

00:06:19.311 --> 00:06:23.115
INVESTIGATION, BUT HE IS THE

00:06:20.012 --> 00:06:24.349
SUBJECT OF A CRIMINAL

00:06:23.248 --> 00:06:25.551
INVESTIGATION AS PART OF AN

00:06:24.483 --> 00:06:27.453
EFFORT TO GET THEM TO SIT DOWN

00:06:25.684 --> 00:06:30.689
TO TESTIFY, AND THE FOCUS SEEMS

00:06:27.586 --> 00:06:31.557
TO BE MUCH MORE ON THE ISSUE OF

00:06:30.823 --> 00:06:32.324
OBSTRUCTION OF JUSTICE THEN

00:06:31.690 --> 00:06:33.892
COLLUSION WITH THE RUSSIANS.

